---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /ministries/
title: Ministries
description: "Explore the ministries of Community Baptist Church of West Covina: music, prayer, Christian education, outreach, seniors, and family and youth."
hero:
  eyebrow: Serving Together
  title: Our Ministries
  intro: God has given each of us gifts to serve one another. There is a place for you to belong and to serve.
---
<section class="section section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="ministry-list">
      {%- for m in ministries %}
      <article class="ministry-detail reveal" id="{{ m.name | slugify }}">
        <span class="ministry-icon">{% icon m.icon %}</span>
        <div>
          <h2>{{ m.name }}</h2>
          <p class="summary">{{ m.summary }}</p>
          <p>{{ m.details }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-ivory">
  <div class="container center reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get Involved</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Find Your Place to Serve</h2>
    <p class="lead-dark" style="max-width: 50ch; margin-inline: auto;">Interested in joining a ministry? Reach out and we will help you get connected.</p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 1.8rem;">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/contact/">Contact the Church{% icon "arrow-right" %}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
